{"id":"talent","lemma":"talent","pos":"noun","rank":1343,"glosses":["a talent (an obsolete unit of weight or money)","a talent, a gift, a knack"],"ipa":"/ta.lɑ̃/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3b/Fr-talent.ogg/Fr-talent.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"talents"},"formAudio":{"talents":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d6/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Le_Commissaire-talents.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Je respecte votre talent.","en":"I respect your talent.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to respect","l":"respecter"},{"g":"your, belonging to you"},null]},{"text":"Son talent est incroyable.","en":"Her talent is amazing.","words":[{"g":"his, her, its"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"incredible"}]},{"text":"Tu as sûrement d'autres talents.","en":"I'm sure you have other skills.","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"surely, certainly"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"other","l":"autre"},null]},{"text":"Ai-je du talent ?","en":"Am I talented?","words":[{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"of the / some"},null]},{"text":"Ça serait gâcher leurs talents.","en":"That would be a waste of their talents.","words":[{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to ruin"},{"g":"them","l":"leur"},null]}]}